From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 10:29:18 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: kaanapali-oneplus-iceland: rear lens at the
 stock start position

Without autofocus in user space the rear lens rests at the far end of
its travel. Stock's camera stack starts every session with the lens at
450 of 1023 (CustomActuatorInitDac of its icelandmain_actuator), which
is sharp from about arm's length to across a table. Give the actuator
that default position: it holds it while the rear sensor streams.

Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
index a47dbae0c661..476baa53359a 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
@@ -1336,6 +1336,8 @@
 
 		dongwoon,sac-mode = <2>;
 		dongwoon,vcm-prescale = <0x79>;
+		/* stock's start position (CustomActuatorInitDac of icelandmain_actuator) */
+		dongwoon,default-position = <450>;
 	};
 
 	/* rear: SmartSens SC1320CS, chip id 0xc658 (stock "icelandmain") */
